          "id": "code-ml-36-2-ch36_2_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: Komparasi 4 Strategi Retraining di Bawah Label Delay 4 Minggu + Concept Drift Minggu ke-9",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "36_2_delayed_label_retraining_comparison.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.ensemble import GradientBoostingClassifier\nfrom sklearn.metrics import average_precision_score, brier_score_loss, f1_score\n\n# Simulasi 20 minggu transaksi pembayaran (N=320/minggu):\n# - Label Delay 4 minggu (chargeback baru terkonfirmasi 4 minggu kemudian)\n# - Concept Drift progresif mulai minggu ke-9 (vektor risiko fraud bergeser!)\ndef gen_week(week: int, n_rows: int = 320):\n    r = np.random.default_rng(1000 + week)\n    X = r.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n_rows, 4))\n    if week < 9:\n        w_true = np.array([1.7, -1.4, 0.5, 0.2])\n        bias = -2.0\n    else:\n        step = min(1.0, (week - 8) / 3.0)\n        w_true = (1.0 - step) * np.array([1.7, -1.4, 0.5, 0.2]) + step * np.array([0.1, 0.2, 2.0, -1.8])\n        bias = -1.9\n    p = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-(X @ w_true + bias)))\n    return X, r.binomial(1, p)\n\nweeks_X, weeks_y = zip(*[gen_week(w) for w in range(20)])\n\ndef fit_gbdt(X_tr, y_tr, sample_weight=None):\n    clf = GradientBoostingClassifier(n_estimators=35, max_depth=3, learning_rate=0.12, random_state=42)\n    clf.fit(X_tr, y_tr, sample_weight=sample_weight)\n    return clf\n\nm_static = fit_gbdt(np.vstack(weeks_X[:4]), np.concatenate(weeks_y[:4]))\nDELAY, HALF_LIFE = 4, 1.5\npolicies = {\"Static\": [], \"Naive_Immature\": [], \"Scheduled_Uniform\": [], \"Decay_Rolling_Matured\": []}\nretrain_counts = {k: 0 for k in policies}\nm_sched = m_decay = m_naive = m_static\n\nfor w in range(6, 20):\n    Xw, yw = weeks_X[w], weeks_y[w]\n\n    # 1. Naive Immature-Label Retrain (BUG FATAL: transaksi 4 minggu belum matang dilabeli y=0!)\n    if w % 2 == 0:\n        X_mat = np.vstack(weeks_X[max(0, w - 10):w - DELAY])\n        y_mat = np.concatenate(weeks_y[max(0, w - 10):w - DELAY])\n        X_imm = np.vstack(weeks_X[w - DELAY:w])\n        m_naive = fit_gbdt(np.vstack([X_mat, X_imm]), np.concatenate([y_mat, np.zeros(len(X_imm), dtype=int)]))\n        retrain_counts[\"Naive_Immature\"] += 1\n\n    # 2. Scheduled Retrain (tiap 4 minggu, HANYA data matang <= w - DELAY, bobot seragam seluruh histori)\n    if w % 4 == 0:\n        m_sched = fit_gbdt(np.vstack(weeks_X[:w - DELAY]), np.concatenate(weeks_y[:w - DELAY]))\n        retrain_counts[\"Scheduled_Uniform\"] += 1\n\n    # 3. Adaptive Rolling Window + Exponential Time-Decay Weights (HANYA data matang <= w - DELAY)\n    if w % 2 == 0:\n        start_w, end_w = max(0, w - DELAY - 6), w - DELAY\n        X_win = np.vstack(weeks_X[start_w:end_w])\n        y_win = np.concatenate(weeks_y[start_w:end_w])\n        ages = np.concatenate([np.full(len(weeks_y[t]), (end_w - 1) - t, dtype=float) for t in range(start_w, end_w)])\n        m_decay = fit_gbdt(X_win, y_win, sample_weight=2.0 ** (-ages / HALF_LIFE))\n        retrain_counts[\"Decay_Rolling_Matured\"] += 1\n\n    for name, mdl in [\n        (\"Static\", m_static),\n        (\"Naive_Immature\", m_naive),\n        (\"Scheduled_Uniform\", m_sched),\n        (\"Decay_Rolling_Matured\", m_decay),\n    ]:\n        probs = mdl.predict_proba(Xw)[:, 1]\n        ap = average_precision_score(yw, probs)\n        f1 = f1_score(yw, (probs >= 0.35).astype(int), zero_division=0)\n        brier = brier_score_loss(yw, probs)\n        policies[name].append((w, ap, f1, brier))\n\nprint(\"=== KOMPARASI 4 STRATEGI RETRAINING (DELAY LABEL 4 MINGGU + CONCEPT DRIFT MINGGU 9) ===\")\nfor name, logs in policies.items():\n    post = [x for x in logs if x[0] >= 14]\n    late_ap = float(np.mean([x[1] for x in post]))\n    late_f1 = float(np.mean([x[2] for x in post]))\n    late_br = float(np.mean([x[3] for x in post]))\n    print(\n        f\"  {name:22s} | Retrains={retrain_counts[name]:2d} | Post-Drift PR-AUC={late_ap:.4f} \"\n        f\"| Post-Drift F1={late_f1:.4f} | Brier={late_br:.4f}\"\n    )",
          "expectedOutput": "=== KOMPARASI 4 STRATEGI RETRAINING (DELAY LABEL 4 MINGGU + CONCEPT DRIFT MINGGU 9) ===\n  Static                 | Retrains= 0 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.3075 | Post-Drift F1=0.2800 | Brier=0.2444\n  Naive_Immature         | Retrains= 7 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.5107 | Post-Drift F1=0.3079 | Brier=0.1859\n  Scheduled_Uniform      | Retrains= 3 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.3514 | Post-Drift F1=0.3010 | Brier=0.2203\n  Decay_Rolling_Matured  | Retrains= 7 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.5818 | Post-Drift F1=0.5678 | Brier=0.1532",
          "actualOutput": "=== KOMPARASI 4 STRATEGI RETRAINING (DELAY LABEL 4 MINGGU + CONCEPT DRIFT MINGGU 9) ===\n  Static                 | Retrains= 0 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.3075 | Post-Drift F1=0.2800 | Brier=0.2444\n  Naive_Immature         | Retrains= 7 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.5107 | Post-Drift F1=0.3079 | Brier=0.1859\n  Scheduled_Uniform      | Retrains= 3 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.3514 | Post-Drift F1=0.3010 | Brier=0.2203\n  Decay_Rolling_Matured  | Retrains= 7 | Post-Drift PR-AUC=0.5818 | Post-Drift F1=0.5678 | Brier=0.1532",
          "explanation": "Mensimulasikan 20 minggu transaksi dengan chargeback delay 4 minggu & concept drift: Decay_Rolling_Matured menang telak di seluruh metrik pasca-drift (PR-AUC 0.5818, F1 0.5678, Brier 0.1532) atas Naive_Immature (F1 runtuh 0.3079) dan Scheduled_Uniform (PR-AUC 0.3514).",
