          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef cbpe_and_decay_ess(probs, threshold: float, ages_days, half_life_days: float) -> tuple[float, float, float, float]:\n    # TODO: hitung CBPE (acc, f1, se_acc) dan Kish ESS dari ages_days & half_life_days\n    pass\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2026)\nz = rng.normal(0.1, 0.85, size=2000)\nprobs_sim = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-1.4 * z))\nages_sim = np.repeat(np.arange(90, dtype=float), 20)\nprint(cbpe_and_decay_ess(probs_sim, 0.50, ages_sim, 21.0))",
