      "tldrSummary": "Sintesis puncak seluruh 36 bab Kurikulum Velqora ML v5.0: arsitektur monolitik naif (1 model + threshold 0.5 + pickle + blind cron) selalu kalah secara finansial dan regulasi melawan Staff+ 7-Layer Architecture! Empat simulasi end-to-end terverifikasi membuktikan: (1) Payment Fraud (<25 ms budget: 21.0 ms): Elkan dinamis memangkas kerugian 43.5% ($8,311 -> $4,697); (2) Ride-Hailing P90 ETA + Pricing: Conformal CQR menaikkan coverage 88.3% -> 92.4% (lebar 1.44x adaptif saat badai) + Tweedie MAPE 15.7%; (3) Regulated Credit: Monotonic GBDT menghapus 54 pelanggaran -> 0, 3-Zona Abstention menaikkan akurasi otomatis 75.8% -> 83.2%, Actionable L1-MAD Recourse & EU AI Act DIR=0.8989; serta (4) B2C Churn Uplift: X-Learner CATE membalik kerugian Naive Churn (-$3,560, Sleeping Dogs 47.6%) menjadi laba +$3,310 (Sleeping Dogs 1.1%) dengan CUPED A/B 4.22x lebih cepat!",
      "description": "Sintesis puncak 36 bab Velqora ML v5.0 ke dalam 7-Layer Staff+ ML System Design Architecture dan 4 cetak biru produksi lengkap: (1) Real-Time Payment Fraud <25ms (HistGBDT + Elkan + Treelite/ONNX + 90d buffer), (2) Ride-Hailing Dynamic Pricing & P90 ETA (Quantile + Conformal CQR + Tweedie), (3) Regulated Credit Underwriting (Monotonic GBDT + 3-Zona Reject Band + Actionable Counterfactual Recourse + EU AI Act), dan (4) B2C Churn Retention Uplift Engine (X-Learner CATE + Qini + CUPED); dilengkapi bukti dominansi matematis, bug-diff monolitik naif vs 7-Layer Staff+, 3 simulasi Python end-to-end terverifikasi, serta war story Super-App $14.6M/tahun.",
